20260919120000000530,20260919120000000529,applies to,20260919120000000137
20260919120000000531,20260919120000000529,tools,a chain checker and a chain tool
20260919120000000532,20260919120000000529,tell,A chain checker drops in at 0.75 per cent
20260919120000000533,20260919120000000529,interval,every 3000 to 5000 km on a road bike
20260919120000000534,20260919120000000529,note,Change it late and you buy a cassette as well
