20260919120000000557,20260919120000000556,wikidata,Q1567709
20260919120000000558,20260919120000000556,means,Running the glycogen out, so the legs and then the judgement go
20260919120000000559,20260919120000000556,tell,The road looks further away than it did ten minutes ago
20260919120000000560,20260919120000000556,note,Eat before you are hungry, because by then it is already too late
