20260919120000000566,20260919120000000566,echelon,20260919120000000507
20260919120000000567,20260919120000000566,means,A diagonal line across the road in a crosswind, each rider sheltering off the one ahead
20260919120000000568,20260919120000000566,note,The road runs out before the line does, which is how a bunch splits
